PATIENT EDUCATION

Treatment Explanation: Without Vitamin D from sunlight or diet, your body cannot absorb calcium. To survive, it has stripped the calcium from your bones, leaving them soft and aching, and leaving your nerves irritable and prone to cramping. The blood tests tomorrow will map exactly how deficient you are so the correct prescription dose can be calculated.
Actionable Steps: Attend the pathology clinic first thing in the morning. Use the walking stick for all mobility.

